        "DefaultText": "Death Cap Ward"
    },
    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_death_cap_ward_placed",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_DeathCapWard_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A grim totem of stakes strung with death cap mushrooms. Set it in the ground and the reek of the toxins keeps wild animals warier of the place where it stands."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_death_cap_ward_placed",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_DeathCapWardPlaced_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Effect:</b> While you are here, a bear, wolf, wolf pack, primeval wolf or boar that attacks you is turned away 25 percent of the time, and so is any other wild-animal encounter that starts without a creature on the map. People are never turned away, and neither is a fight you start yourself.\n\n<b>Decay:</b> The mushrooms rot in about ten days, and the ward rots with them. Picking it up does not stop the rot.\n\n<b>Pick Up:</b> Retrieve the ward to move it.\n\n<b>Dismantle:</b> Get the 2 long sticks back; the mushrooms are lost."
    },
